Next, after the tail fix: Michael wants richer content types on /live/, all of them. Each one is a registered class that voice can add and update through the item tool:
1) a checklist card: items with done flags, toggled by delta;
2) a status light: on/off/color, e.g. {"light":{"on":true,"color":"green"}};
3) a button card: clicking runs a named method, and voice can also "press" it via delta.
Keep each one small and in the core pattern. Reply with the exact deltas for each.

